{"ok": true, "summary": "The model represents an electronic expansion valve with a 32 mm OD × 60 mm brass body, 9.52 mm OD copper inlet and outlet tubes, and a 28 mm OD × 35 mm top-mounted stepper assembly. Section view exposes the needle, seat, and blue refrigerant passages; exploded view separates the principal components. Unspecified dimensions are assumed: both tubes have 0.8 mm walls and 30 mm exposed lengths, the internal chamber is 12 mm diameter × 44 mm, and the motor housing wall is 2 mm. Brass mass deducts the modeled chamber, inlet bore, outlet socket, and 1.6 mm orifice. Tube mass excludes insertion allowances. Overall height is 125 mm. This is a conceptual engineering model, not a manufacturing drawing.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Electronic Expansion Valve</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#26323d}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\n.legend{font-size:12px}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;right:10%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:#fff;padding:18px;z-index:10}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Electronic Expansion Valve</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">Body: Ø32 × 60 mm · Orifice: Ø1.6 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Tubes: Ø9.52 × 0.8 mm wall; 30 mm each</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Stepper: Ø28 × 35 mm · Chamber: Ø12 × 44 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"mass\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"height\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">Assumed internals; blue = refrigerant volume</div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#c9a227\"></span>Brass body · <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></span>Copper tubes / winding</div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#2b2b2b\"></span>Plastic housing · <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#9aa3ab\"></span>Steel needle / rotor</div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Flow path · <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#1f4e79\"></span>Electronics</div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Dimensions in mm; densities in g/cm³. Unspecified internals are conceptual.\n  bodyOD:32, bodyH:60, tubeOD:9.52, tubeWall:0.8,\n  inletLength:30, outletLength:30, inletY:27,\n  motorOD:28, motorH:35, housingWall:2,\n  chamberD:12, chamberBottom:10, chamberTop:54,\n  outletSocketD:7.92, outletSocketH:6, orificeD:1.6,\n  needleD:3, needleTipY:10.8, needleConeH:5, needleTop:72,\n  rotorD:10, rotorH:21, rotorY:77,\n  coilOD:23, coilID:13, coilH:24, coilY:77.5,\n  boardW:15, boardH:2, boardD:12, boardY:91,\n  brassDensity:8.50, copperDensity:8.96,\n  metalness:0.85, roughness:0.35, plasticRoughness:0.6,\n  flowOpacity:0.55, segments:64, explodeBody:0,\n  explodeInlet:18, explodeOutlet:18, explodeMotor:24, explodeNeedle:12,\n  colors:{brass:'#c9a227',copper:'#b87333',steel:'#9aa3ab',\n    plastic:'#2b2b2b',flow:'#3b82f6',electronics:'#1f4e79'}\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');\n  el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(90,160,120);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const clipPlane=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),0);\n  const cutMaterials=[];\n  function material(color,plastic=false,cut=true){\n    const mat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness:plastic?0:P.metalness,\n      roughness:plastic?P.plasticRoughness:P.roughness,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n    if(cut)cutMaterials.push(mat);\n    return mat;\n  }\n  const brass=material(P.colors.brass),copper=material(P.colors.copper);\n  const plastic=material(P.colors.plastic,true),winding=material(P.colors.copper);\n  const steel=material(P.colors.steel,false,false);\n  const electronics=material(P.colors.electronics,true);\n  const flow=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.colors.flow,transparent:true,\n    opacity:P.flowOpacity,depthWrite:false,metalness:0,roughness:0.3,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const body=new THREE.Group(),inlet=new THREE.Group(),outlet=new THREE.Group();\n  const motor=new THREE.Group(),needle=new THREE.Group(),fluid=new THREE.Group();\n  modelGroup.add(body,inlet,outlet,motor,needle,fluid);\n  function mesh(geometry,mat,parent,x=0,y=0,z=0){\n    const m=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,mat);m.position.set(x,y,z);parent.add(m);return m;\n  }\n  function cylinder(radius,height,mat,parent,x,y,z=0){\n    return mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(radius,radius,height,P.segments),mat,parent,x,y,z);\n  }\n  function ring(ro,ri,height,mat,parent,x,y,z=0){\n    const points=[[ri,0],[ro,0],[ro,height],[ri,height],[ri,0]]\n      .map(p=>new THREE.Vector2(p[0],p[1]));\n    return mesh(new THREE.LatheGeometry(points,P.segments),mat,parent,x,y,z);\n  }\n  const R=P.bodyOD/2,rc=P.chamberD/2,rt=P.tubeOD/2-P.tubeWall;\n  const inletStart=Math.sqrt(rc*rc-rt*rt);\n  // Revolved body has a real chamber, stepped outlet bore and seat.\n  const profile=[[P.outletSocketD/2,0],[R,0],[R,P.bodyH],[0,P.bodyH],\n    [0,P.chamberTop],[rc,P.chamberTop],[rc,P.chamberBottom],\n    [P.orificeD/2,P.chamberBottom],[P.orificeD/2,P.outletSocketH],\n    [P.outletSocketD/2,P.outletSocketH],[P.outletSocketD/2,0]];\n  const bodyMesh=mesh(new THREE.LatheGeometry(profile.map(p=>new THREE.Vector2(...p)),P.segments),brass,body);\n  // Discard the radial inlet bore in body shading, without external CSG libraries.\n  brass.onBeforeCompile=shader=>{\n    shader.vertexShader=shader.vertexShader.replace('#include <common>',\n      '#include <common>\\nvarying vec3 vLocal;');\n    shader.vertexShader=shader.vertexShader.replace('#include <begin_vertex>',\n      '#include <begin_vertex>\\nvLocal=position;');\n    shader.fragmentShader=shader.fragmentShader.replace('#include <common>',\n      '#include <common>\\nvarying vec3 vLocal;');\n    shader.fragmentShader=shader.fragmentShader.replace('#include <clipping_planes_fragment>',\n      `#include <clipping_planes_fragment>\n      if(vLocal.x>=${inletStart.toFixed(8)} && length(vec2(vLocal.y-${P.inletY.toFixed(8)},vLocal.z))<${rt.toFixed(8)}) discard;`);\n  };\n  const boreMat=material(P.colors.brass);\n  const bore=cylinder(rt,R-rc,boreMat,body,(R+rc)/2,P.inletY);\n  bore.geometry.dispose();\n  bore.geometry=new THREE.CylinderGeometry(rt,rt,R-rc,P.segments,1,true);\n  bore.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n  const inTube=ring(P.tubeOD/2,rt,P.inletLength,copper,inlet,R,P.inletY);\n  inTube.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n  ring(P.tubeOD/2,rt,P.outletLength,copper,outlet,0,-P.outletLength);\n  ring(P.motorOD/2,P.motorOD/2-P.housingWall,P.motorH,plastic,motor,0,P.bodyH);\n  cylinder(P.motorOD/2,P.housingWall,plastic,motor,0,P.bodyH+P.motorH-P.housingWall/2);\n  ring(P.coilOD/2,P.coilID/2,P.coilH,winding,motor,0,P.coilY-P.coilH/2);\n  cylinder(P.rotorD/2,P.rotorH,steel,motor,0,P.rotorY);\n  mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.boardW,P.boardH,P.boardD),electronics,motor,0,P.boardY);\n  const cone=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.needleD/2,0,P.needleConeH,P.segments),\n    steel,needle,0,P.needleTipY+P.needleConeH/2);\n  const shaftBottom=P.needleTipY+P.needleConeH;\n  cylinder(P.needleD/2,P.needleTop-shaftBottom,steel,needle,0,(shaftBottom+P.needleTop)/2);\n  cylinder(rc,P.chamberTop-P.chamberBottom,flow,fluid,0,(P.chamberTop+P.chamberBottom)/2);\n  const feed=cylinder(rt,R+P.inletLength-inletStart,flow,fluid,(R+P.inletLength+inletStart)/2,P.inletY);\n  feed.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n  cylinder(rt,P.outletLength+P.outletSocketH,flow,fluid,0,(P.outletSocketH-P.outletLength)/2);\n  cylinder(P.orificeD/2,P.chamberBottom-P.outletSocketH,flow,fluid,0,(P.chamberBottom+P.outletSocketH)/2);\n  // Integrate the non-overlapping radial bore volume through the curved body wall.\n  let radialVolume=0;const steps=20000,dz=2*rt/steps;\n  for(let i=0;i<steps;i++){\n    const z=-rt+(i+0.5)*dz;\n    radialVolume+=2*Math.sqrt(rt*rt-z*z)*(Math.sqrt(R*R-z*z)-Math.sqrt(rc*rc-z*z))*dz;\n  }\n  const brassVolume=Math.PI*R*R*P.bodyH-Math.PI*rc*rc*(P.chamberTop-P.chamberBottom)\n    -Math.PI*(P.outletSocketD/2)**2*P.outletSocketH\n    -Math.PI*(P.orificeD/2)**2*(P.chamberBottom-P.outletSocketH)-radialVolume;\n  const copperVolume=Math.PI*((P.tubeOD/2)**2-rt*rt)*(P.inletLength+P.outletLength);\n  const metrics=[\n    {label:'Brass body mass',value:(brassVolume*P.brassDensity/1e6).toFixed(4),unit:'kg',note:'Net bores deducted; density 8.50 g/cm³'},\n    {label:'Copper-tube mass',value:(copperVolume*P.copperDensity/1e6).toFixed(4),unit:'kg',note:'Two tubes; no insertion allowance'},\n    {label:'Overall valve height',value:(P.bodyH+P.motorH+P.outletLength).toFixed(1),unit:'mm',note:'Assembled; bottom tube to motor top'},\n    {label:'Total copper-tube length',value:(P.inletLength+P.outletLength).toFixed(1),unit:'mm',note:'Assumed exposed lengths: 30 mm each'},\n    {label:'Orifice area',value:(Math.PI*(P.orificeD/2)**2).toFixed(3),unit:'mm²',note:'Geometric bore area; not effective flow'}\n  ];\n  window.__metrics=metrics;\n  document.getElementById('mass').textContent=`Brass: ${metrics[0].value} kg · Tubes: ${metrics[1].value} kg`;\n  document.getElementById('height').textContent=`Overall height: ${metrics[2].value} mm · Orifice area: ${metrics[4].value} mm²`;\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(220,22,0xd7d2ca,0xe7e2da);\n  grid.position.y=-P.outletLength-0.5;scene.add(grid);\n  function fit(){\n    const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n    const center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n    const fov=THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(camera.fov);\n    const angle=Math.min(fov,2*Math.atan(Math.tan(fov/2)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(angle/2)/0.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  let section=false,exploded=false;\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=()=>{\n    section=!section;cutMaterials.forEach(m=>{m.clippingPlanes=section?[clipPlane]:[];m.needsUpdate=true;});\n    document.getElementById('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;const t=exploded?1:0;\n    inlet.position.x=t*P.explodeInlet;outlet.position.y=-t*P.explodeOutlet;\n    motor.position.y=t*P.explodeMotor;needle.position.y=t*P.explodeNeedle;\n    fluid.visible=!exploded;document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';fit();\n  };\n  function rotateLabel(){document.getElementById('rotate').textContent='Auto-rotate: '+(controls.autoRotate?'on':'off');}\n  document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;rotateLabel();};\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;rotateLabel();});\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n    camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);fit();\n  });\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;\n  window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  fit();\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Brass body mass", "value": "0.3610", "unit": "kg", "note": "Net bores deducted; density 8.50 g/cm³"}, {"label": "Copper-tube mass", "value": "0.0118", "unit": "kg", "note": "Two tubes; no insertion allowance"}, {"label": "Overall valve height", "value": "125.0", "unit": "mm", "note": "Assembled; bottom tube to motor top"}, {"label": "Total copper-tube length", "value": "60.0", "unit": "mm", "note": "Assumed exposed lengths: 30 mm each"}, {"label": "Orifice area", "value": "2.011", "unit": "mm²", "note": "Geometric bore area; not effective flow"}], "suggestions": ["Change both copper tubes to 40 mm exposed length and recalculate mass and height.", "Add tube insertion sockets and brazing allowances to refine the brass mass.", "Compare 1.6 mm and 2.0 mm orifices with adjustable needle lift."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nThe model represents an electronic expansion valve with a 32 mm OD × 60 mm brass body, 9.52 mm OD copper inlet and outlet tubes, and a 28 mm OD × 35 mm top-mounted stepper assembly. Section view exposes the needle, seat, and blue refrigerant passages; exploded view separates the principal components. Unspecified dimensions are assumed: both tubes have 0.8 mm walls and 30 mm exposed lengths, the internal chamber is 12 mm diameter × 44 mm, and the motor housing wall is 2 mm. Brass mass deducts the modeled chamber, inlet bore, outlet socket, and 1.6 mm orifice. Tube mass excludes insertion allowances. Overall height is 125 mm. This is a conceptual engineering model, not a manufacturing drawing.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Electronic Expansion Valve</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#26323d}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\n.legend{font-size:12px}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;right:10%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:#fff;padding:18px;z-index:10}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Electronic Expansion Valve</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">Body: Ø32 × 60 mm · Orifice: Ø1.6 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Tubes: Ø9.52 × 0.8 mm wall; 30 mm each</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Stepper: Ø28 × 35 mm · Chamber: Ø12 × 44 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"mass\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"height\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">Assumed internals; blue = refrigerant volume</div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#c9a227\"></span>Brass body · <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></span>Copper tubes / winding</div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#2b2b2b\"></span>Plastic housing · <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#9aa3ab\"></span>Steel needle / rotor</div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Flow path · <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#1f4e79\"></span>Electronics</div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Dimensions in mm; densities in g/cm³. Unspecified internals are conceptual.\n  bodyOD:32, bodyH:60, tubeOD:9.52, tubeWall:0.8,\n  inletLength:30, outletLength:30, inletY:27,\n  motorOD:28, motorH:35, housingWall:2,\n  chamberD:12, chamberBottom:10, chamberTop:54,\n  outletSocketD:7.92, outletSocketH:6, orificeD:1.6,\n  needleD:3, needleTipY:10.8, needleConeH:5, needleTop:72,\n  rotorD:10, rotorH:21, rotorY:77,\n  coilOD:23, coilID:13, coilH:24, coilY:77.5,\n  boardW:1